--- ISSUE 1/7 ---
id: CLR-003
severity: critical
category: color-contrast
found_by: static
title: Normal-size body text meets 4.5:1 contrast ratio
problem: 8 same-rule text/background pair(s) compute below 3:1 contrast — unreadable at any text size.
why_it_matters: Text below 24 px (or 18.67 px bold) requires a minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio against its background to be readable by users with moderate low vision.
standards: wcag:1.4.3
